<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First USA cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First USA cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- First Boston said it downgraded First USA Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details are not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- First USA gained 1-5/8 to 47 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
